        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.22.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Od-dur 22.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyu Daudini waan gumi ch'ufaani jed'e, Ilmi kiyya Solomoni ka Waaqi fohate diqa, ammalle arga d'ageeti womatu inqabu. Hujiini hojachu malani muumme inqabdu, wonti akanatiifi mani sunini ka hayyutiniti, ammo ka AABBO Waaqati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini haga dandau yayu miha Mana Waaqatini jaarani kurfeese — worqi, qarsi, sibiila diima, sibiila, guraacha, mukha, d'akhaaye ch'uch'ulut'ufi, d'akhaaye mimid'aadu d'ibi, d'akhaaye daakhaani barreesanifi ch'abbi ch'uch'ulut'u hedule. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan anini kurfeese kana malele, anini yayu qarsifi worqi tiyya, ta anini olkeyad'e keesa, maro anini Mana Waaqa jaalad'eefi, baase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worqi anini baase suni ulfinni isii kilo kuma d'ibba tokoti, ta lafa ofiriti d'ufte; ammalle anini yayu qarsi dansa, ulfinni isii kilo kuma d'iba lamatiifi afurtama, aka naabo Mana sunitini barreesanifi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miha hogeeyini mid'aasitu ch'ufaleeni mid'aasani, baase. Amma isani keesa eenuti garaa tokooni, fed'i ufiitini, AABBO Waaqa jed'e woi baasaa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani worri balbala gosaati matatifi jaaroleeni gosatifi worri gugurda askartitifi worri hori hayyu qorqoratuleeni, garaa tokooni, fed'i ufi gula, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waan kana baase: worqi kilo kuma d'ibbafi torbatama, qarsi kilo kuma d'ibba saadiifi afurtama, sibiila diima kilo kuma d'ibba jaatiifi diddama, ammalle sibiila guraacha kilo kuma maro kuma saditifi kuma d'ibba afuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami d'akhaaye ch'uch'ulut'u qabuleeni Mana Waaqatii baase, duuba nami waan suni olkaye, Yehieli, ka gosa Lawi, balbala Gershoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biyyiti waan heddu garaa tokooni AABBO Waaqa baafte kana ch'ufa guddo iraa gammade, hayyu Daudileni waan suni ch'ufa guddo iraa gammade.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Daudini Waaqa faarse",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani hayyu Daudini gumi suni ch'ufa durati AABBO Waaqa akana jed'e faarse: Ee AABBO, Waaqa ababo keenna Yakobo, haga jiru jireenna ha si faarsani! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.6.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 6.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Irreefi humnaafi, guddinnaafi mid'aagumafi jabeenni keetuma. Wonti gubbafi lafa keesa jiraleeni ch'ufti keetuma, atini hayyu hayyu ch'ufa mohatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duroomafi qabeeni ch'ufti gara kanketi d'ufa; atini jabeennaafi irreeni waan ch'ufa mohata; atini dandeete nama feetu guddifte, jabeenna kennitaafi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma, Waaqa keenna, nu galata si deebifne maqa kanke gudda faarsina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo anaafi worri lafa tiyya eenu qara, ka nu dandeenne waan kana ch'ufa akana si baamnu? Wonti ch'ufti garuma keeti baati, nuleeni woma qara atini nu kennite sii kennina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atini imbeeta, ee AABBO Waaqa, aka nu si durati akuma abbooti teenna keessumafi nama lafa inqamne fakaannu. Guyyaani keenna lafa tana irati gabaaba, dandeenne lubbu duraa imbaanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee AABBO Waaqa keenna, wonti nu hori kana ch'ufa baamneefi, aka mana maqa kanke keesati guddisani jaarru, ammo wonti kunini ch'ufti siuma iraa d'ufte, keetuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini imbeekha, aka atini onne nama ch'ufa ilaalte nama d'uga iraa gammaddu. Fed'ifi garaa tokooni anini waan kana ch'ufa sii baase, ammalle anini aka gumiini tante tunini gammadani waan kana ch'ufa sii baaftu ya arge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee AABBO Waaqa ababoota teenna Abrahamutifi Isaaqotifi ka Israeli, herega akana kana qalbi gumi teeti keesa kayi, guyya ch'ufa qalbilbi sii saalfatu worraa kenni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilma kiyya Solomoni qarqaari, aka inni hojja ch'ufa aadaafi seera kanke guute, Mana anini waan isaa kurfeese kana jaaru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Daudini waan gumi ch'ufaani jed'e, AABBO Waaqa keesani faarsa! Jennaani gumiini ch'ufti AABBO, Waaqa ababoota isaani faarsite, AABBO Waaqafi hayyu durati gajejete guddifte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boriyyaate hori qalani, gubani sorio AABBO Waaqaa baasani, duuba eege biyyaa kennani nyaachisani. Suni malele koromi kuma tokotifi elemiye kuma tokotifi imoole holla ta kuma tokole gubani sorio baasani. Ammalle worri daad'ile Waaqaa baase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akanaani guyya suni, AABBO Waaqa durati, nyaatani d'ugaani gammadani. Jennaani maro lameeso Solomoni ilma Daudi hayyu Lalabani, maqa AABBO Waaqatini isa muudani, hayyu tolchani, Sadokile qaallu tolchani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.2.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Hay 2.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba akasiini Solomonini fulla abba isaa Daudi hayyu tahe, barch'uma isaa ka hayyuma ira tae. Inni hayyu gurra qabu tahe, gumiini Israelileni ch'ufti isaa saalfate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hojatufi askartifi ilmaani Daudi d'ibileeni aka isaa saalfatu kakhate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi gosa Israeli ch'ufa durati Solomoni guddise maqa jaba kenneefi, ammalle hayyu duraani Israeli mohate ch'ufa ira guddinna kenneefi.",
          "type": "text",
