          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan Daudini tolche ch'ufa, haguma geetunu, kitaaba raagoota tana sadeeni keesati t'aafani: Samueli, Nathani, Gadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
