              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woniti isaa ka t'aafani suni aka inni lafa mohatefi jabeenna isaatiifi ammalle waan isaafi worra Israelitiifi gochiti d'aatu worraa jirtuleeni taate garsiifti.",
